2026-07-27T09:38:03.4468485Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:38:03.4468802Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:38:03.4469295Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:38:03.4470031Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:38:03.4470750Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
